{"ticker":"TTWO","updated":"2026-10-30T23:18:32Z","profile":{"longName":"Take-Two Interactive Software, Inc.","shortName":"Take-Two Interactive Software, ","sector":"Communication Services","industry":"Electronic Gaming & Multimedia","country":"United States","website":"https://www.take2games.com","fullTimeEmployees":12909,"marketCap":35558072320,"trailingPE":null,"forwardPE":18.50106,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":5.31789,"pegRatio":2.65,"targetMeanPrice":285.13138,"targetHighPrice":330.0,"targetLowPrice":170.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":29,"recommendationKey":"strong_buy","revenueGrowth":0.02,"earningsGrowth":null,"grossMargins":0.57126,"operatingMargins":0.0051499996,"profitMargins":-0.04792,"totalRevenue":6686499840,"beta":0.974,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":265.94,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":183.86,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NMS","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":0.0},"summary":"Take-Two Interactive Software, Inc. develops, publishes, and markets interactive entertainment solutions for consumers worldwide. The company develops and publishes action/adventure products under the Grand Theft Auto, LA Noire, Max Payne, Midnight Club, and Red Dead Redemption names, as well as other franchises. It also publishes various entertainment properties across various platforms and a range of genres, such as shooter, action, role-playing, strategy, sports, and family/casual entertainment under the BioShock, Mafia, Sid Meier's Civilization, XCOM series, Borderlands, and Tiny Tina's Wonderland names. In addition, the company publishes sports simulation titles comprising NBA 2K series, a basketball video game; the WWE 2K professional wrestling series; mobile titles, including WWE SuperCard; and PGA TOUR 2K. Further, it offers free-to-play mobile games, such as CSR Racing, Dragon City, Empires & Puzzles, FarmVille 3, Game of Thrones: Legends, Golf Rival, Harry Potter: Puzzles & Spells, Hit It Rich!, Match Factory!, Merge Dragons!, Merge Magic!, Monster Legends, NBA 2K, Toon Blast, Top Eleven, Wizard Of Oz Slots Casino, Toy Blast, Words With Friends, and Zynga Poker; and Color Block Jam. The company's products are designed for console gaming systems; and mobiles, such as smartphones, tablets, and personal computers. It provides its products through physical retail, digital","summary_zh":"Take-Two Interactive Software, Inc. 為全球消費者開發、發布和行銷互動娛樂解決方案。該公司以 Grand Theft Auto、LA Noire、Max Payne、Midnight Club、Red Dead Redemption 以及其他系列產品開發和發布動作/冒險產品。它也以《生化奇兵》、《黑手黨》、《席德·梅爾的文明》、《XCOM》系列、《無主之地》和《小蒂娜的仙境》為名，在不同平台和一系列類型上發佈各種娛樂產品，例如射擊遊戲、動作遊戲、角色扮演遊戲、策略遊戲、體育遊戲以及家庭/休閒娛樂遊戲。此外，該公司還發行運動模擬遊戲，包括NBA 2K系列、籃球電玩； WWE 2K 職業摔角系列；手機遊戲，包括 WWE SuperCard；和 PGA TOUR 2K。此外，它還提供免費手機遊戲，如CSR Racing、Dragon City、Empires & Puzzles、FarmVille 3、權力的遊戲：傳奇、高爾夫球對手、哈利波特：謎題與咒語、Hit It Rich!、Match Factory!、Merge Dragons!、Merge Magicy、Monster Legends、TodderK、Casoon BlastT、Tro西、Wlastft）、C等。 Zynga 撲克；和色塊果醬。該公司的產品專為遊戲機遊戲系統而設計；以及行動設備，例如智慧型手機、平板電腦和個人電腦。它透過實體零售、數位零售等方式提供產品","sector_zh":"通訊服務","industry_zh":"電子遊戲和多媒體","candles":[{"t":"2025-09-02","o":231.16,"h":241.08,"l":229.33,"c":240.95,"v":1860300},{"t":"2025-09-03","o":241.0,"h":242.3,"l":237.03,"c":238.86,"v":1208700},{"t":"2025-09-04","o":238.53,"h":240.84,"l":237.37,"c":240.65,"v":915400},{"t":"2025-09-05","o":242.0,"h":242.69,"l":236.94,"c":239.68,"v":979400},{"t":"2025-09-08","o":241.78,"h":250.45,"l":241.4,"c":248.78,"v":2214500},{"t":"2025-09-09","o":249.28,"h":250.0,"l":247.27,"c":247.86,"v":997500},{"t":"2025-09-10","o":248.58,"h":248.58,"l":243.46,"c":244.04,"v":1116400},{"t":"2025-09-11","o":246.07,"h":248.0,"l":244.89,"c":246.54,"v":976800},{"t":"2025-09-12","o":245.97,"h":248.3,"l":244.03,"c":246.26,"v":1001700},{"t":"2025-09-15","o":246.25,"h":250.25,"l":245.92,"c":247.25,"v":1333400},{"t":"2025-09-16","o":247.54,"h":250.96,"l":246.72,"c":247.73,"v":1764100},{"t":"2025-09-17","o":248.0,"h":251.2,"l":245.7,"c":250.52,"v":1690900},{"t":"2025-09-18","o":251.09,"h":252.61,"l":249.11,"c":249.74,"v":2167000},{"t":"2025-09-19","o":251.96,"h":252.4,"l":247.8