"雲端/軟體","count":14},{"name":"財報","count":3},{"name":"分析師評等","count":3},{"name":"併購","count":1}],"biz":{"tenk":{"form":"10-K","date":"2026-05-22","period":"2026-03-31","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/946581/000162828026037434/ttwo-20260331.htm"},"overview":[{"en":"We are a leading developer, publisher, and marketer of interactive entertainment for consumers around the globe. We develop, operate, and publish products principally through Rockstar Games, 2K, and Zynga. Our products are currently designed for console gaming systems, mobile, including smartphones and tablets, and personal computer (\"PC\"). We deliver our products through physical retail, digital download, online platforms, and cloud streaming services.","zh":"我們是為全球消費者提供互動娛樂的領先開發商、發行商和行銷人員。我們主要透過 Rockstar Games、2K 和 Zynga 開發、營運和發布產品。我們的產品目前專為遊戲機遊戲系統、行動裝置（包括智慧型手機和平板電腦）以及個人電腦（「PC」）而設計。我們透過實體零售、數位下載、線上平台和雲端串流服務提供產品。"},{"en":"Our website address is www.take2games.com. We make all of our filings with the Securities and Exchange Commission (\"SEC\") available free of charge on our website under the caption \"Investors—Financial Information—SEC Filings.\" Included in these filings are our annual reports on Form 10-K, quarterly reports on Form 10-Q, current reports on Form 8-K, and amendments to those reports, which are available as soon as reasonably practicable after we electronically file or furnish such materials with the SEC pursuant to Section 13(a) or 15(d) of the Securities Exchange Act of 1934, as amended (the \"Exchange Act\"). Our website and the information contained therein or connected thereto are not intended to be incorporated into this Annual Report on Form 10-K. The SEC maintains a website that contains annual, quarterly, and current reports, proxy and information statements and other information that","zh":"我們的網址是 www.take2games.com。我們向美國證券交易委員會（「SEC」）提交的所有文件均在我們的網站上免費提供，標題為「投資者—財務資訊—SEC 文件」。這些文件中包括我們的 10-K 表年度報告、10-Q 表季度報告、8-K 表當前報告以及對這些報告的修訂，在我們根據經修訂的 1934 年證券交易法（「交易法」）第 13(a) 或 15(d) 條以電子方式向 SEC 提交或提供此類材料後，我們會在合理的情況下提供這些材料後，我們會盡快提供這些資料後，我們會盡快提供這些資料後，我們會盡快提供這些資料。我們的網站以及其中包含或與之相關的資訊無意納入本年度報告 10-K 表格中。 SEC 維護一個網站，其中包含年度、季度和當前報告、委託書和資訊聲明以及其他資訊"},{"en":"Overview. Our strategy is to create hit entertainment experiences, delivered on every platform relevant to our audience through a variety of sound business models. Our pillars - creativity, innovation, and efficiency - guide us as we strive to create the highest quality, most captivating experiences for our consumers. We believe that our player-first approach and commitment to creativity and innovation are distinguishing strengths, enabling us to differentiate our products in the marketplace by combining advanced technology with compelling gameplay that provide unique, deeply engaging experiences.","zh":"概述。我們的策略是創造熱門娛樂體驗，透過各種健全的商業模式在與觀眾相關的每個平台上提供。我們的支柱——創造力、創新和效率——指導我們努力為消費者創造最高品質、最迷人的體驗。我們相信，玩家至上的態度以及對創造力和創新的承諾是我們的獨特優勢，使我們能夠透過將先進技術與引人入勝的遊戲玩法相結合，提供獨特、深入的體驗，從而使我們的產品在市場上脫穎而出。"}],"markets":[{"en":"We derive substantially all of our revenue from the sale of our interactive entertainment content, which includes internally developed software titles and software titles developed by third parties, in-game virtual items and advertising, and live services on console, mobile, and PC. Operating margins are dependent in part upon our ability to release new, commercially successful software products and to manage effectively their development and marketing costs. We have internal development studios located in Australia, Canada, China, Czech Republic, Finland, Germany, Hungary, India, Serbia, South Korea, Spain, Turkey, the United Kingdom (\"U.K.\"), and the United States (\"U.S.\"). As of March 31, 2026, we had a research and development staff of 9,998 full-time employees with the technical capabilities to develop software titles for all major consoles, PCs, and mobile platforms in multiple lan","zh":"我們幾乎所有的收入都來自互動娛樂內容的銷售，其中包括內部開發的軟體產品和第三方開發的軟體產品、遊戲內虛擬物品和廣告以及遊戲機、行動裝置和 PC 上的即時服務。營業利潤部分取決於我們發布新的、商業上成功的軟體產品以及有效管理其開發和行銷成本的能力。我們在澳洲、加拿大、中國、捷克共和國、芬蘭、德國、匈牙利、印度、塞爾維亞、韓國、西班牙、土耳其、英國（「英國」）和美國（「美國」）設有內部開發工作室。截至2026年3月31日，我們擁有9,998名全職研發人員，具備為多個區域網路中的所有主要遊戲機、PC和行動平台開發軟體的技術能力。"},{"en":"We engage in evolving business models such as online gaming, virtual currency, add-on content, and in-game purchases, and we expect to continue to generate incremental revenue from these opportunities. We also generate revenue from advertising primarily within our mobile software products.","zh":"我們致力於不斷發展的商業模式，例如線上遊戲、虛擬貨幣、附加內容和遊戲內購買，我們預計將繼續從這些機會中產生增量收入。我們也主要透過行動軟體產品內的廣告獲得收入。"}],"customers":[{"en":"We are dependent on a limited number of customers that account for a significant portion of our sales. Sales to our five largest customers during the fiscal year ended March 31, 2026, accounted for 80.6% of our net revenue, with Apple, Sony, Google, and Microsoft each accounting for more than 10.0% of our net revenue.","zh":"我們依賴數量有限的客戶，而這些客戶占我們銷售額的很大一部分。截至 2026 年 3 月 31 日的財年中，對我們最大的五個客戶的銷售占我們淨收入的 80.6%，其中蘋果、索尼、谷歌和微軟分別占我們淨收入的 10.0% 以上。"}],"competition":[{"en":"Competition in the interactive entertainment industry is based on innovation, features, playability, product quality, brand name recognition, compatibility with popular platforms, access to distribution channels, price, marketing, and customer service. Our business is driven by hit titles, which require increasing budgets for development and marketing. Competition for our titles is influenced by the timing of competitive product releases and the similarity of such products to our titles.","zh":"互動娛樂產業的競爭是基於創新、功能、可玩性、產品品質、品牌知名度、與流行平台的兼容性、分銷管道、價格、行銷和客戶服務。我們的業務由熱門遊戲推動，這需要增加開發和行銷預算。我們的遊戲的競爭受到競爭產品發佈時間以及此類產品與我們遊戲的相似性的影響。"},{"en":"Other interactive entertainment companies that range in size and cost structure from very small with limited resources to very large with greater financial, marketing, technical, and other resources than ours. Examples of our competitors include Electronic Arts, Embracer Group, Epic Games, Playrix, Playtika, Roblox, Savvy Games, Tencent, and Ubisoft. We also expect new competitors to enter the market and existing competitors to allocate more resources to develop and market competing games and applications.","zh":"其他互動娛樂公司的規模和成本結構各不相同，從資源有限的小型公司到擁有比我們更多的財務、行銷、技術和其他資源的大型公司。我們的競爭對手包括 Electronic Arts、Embracer Group、Epic Games、Playrix、Playtika、Roblox、Savvy Games、騰訊和 Ubisoft。我們也預期新的競爭對手將進入市場，而現有的競爭對手將分配更多資源來開發和行銷競爭性遊戲和應用程式。"}],"segments":{"prod":{"end":"2026-03-31","items":[{"name":"Digital Online","val":6459700000,"zh":"數位線上"},{"name":"Game","val":6162100000,"zh":"遊戲"},{"name":"Recurrent Customer Spending","val":5196600000,"zh":"經常性客戶支出"},{"name":"Mobile","val":3333000000,"zh":"移動的"},{"name":"Console","val":2597300000,"zh":"安慰"},{"name":"Full Game & Other","val":1459800000,"zh":"完整遊戲及其他"},{"name":"PC & Other Products","val":726100000,"zh":"電腦及其他產品"},{"name":"Advertising","val":494300000,"zh":"廣告"},{"name":"Physical Retail & Other","val":196700000,"zh":"實體零售及其他"}],"total":6656400000},"geo":{"end":"2026-03-31","items":[{"name":"US","val":3940400000,"zh":"美國"},{"name":"Non Us","val":2716000000,"zh":"非我們"}],"total":6656400000}},"peers":["TWLO","TTD","ADSK","OKTA","ETSY"]}}